<section class="quick" id="new-business-setup">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">New Business Tech Setup</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Starting a business but not sure where to begin with the tech?</h2>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;">You've got the business idea, the skills and the motivation. But then come all the decisions about domains, business emails, bookings, forms, payments, customer information and how everything should work together.</p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">I'll help you work out which systems your business needs, get everything set up and make sure it works properly. No unnecessary subscriptions, complicated systems or tech for the sake of it.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:28px;">What can I help you set up?</h3>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px;">Depending on your business, this might include a business domain and professional email, booking and appointment systems, enquiry forms and customer onboarding, payment and invoicing tools, organising customer information, connecting tools with simple workflows, and testing everything. You won't necessarily need all of these. We'll focus on what's right for your business.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:28px;">How we can work together</h3>
    <ul style="margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:22px; color:#3a4456; line-height:1.8;">
      <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Done for you:</strong> You tell me what you need, we agree the setup and I handle the technical work. Once everything is ready, I'll walk you through how it works.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Done with you:</strong> We book dedicated working time and build things together, so you can ask questions and see how everything works as we go.</li>
      <li><strong>A mix of both:</strong> We work out the requirements together, I handle the build and then we review and test everything before handover.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:28px;">What does it cost?</h3>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px;"><strong>From £300.</strong> The final price depends on what you already have, what needs building and how much work is involved. The full page has three example setups, and I'll provide a clear quote and agreed scope before any work begins. Software subscriptions and third-party costs are separate.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/new-business-tech-setup/">See What's Included</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://calendar.app.google/5X8u7FaaufFGnoS19" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Let's Talk About Your Setup</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

