    <h2 class="section-title">Your tech to-do list. Finally getting done.</h2>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;">Sometimes you don't need a big project or a lengthy consultation. You just need dedicated time with someone who can help you get things sorted.</p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">This might involve fixing a broken workflow, connecting two systems, setting up a new process, sorting out an existing tool or working through several smaller jobs.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:28px;">How it works</h3>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px;">Tell me what you're trying to achieve and we'll agree how best to use the time. We can work together live, sharing screens and making changes as we go, or agree the tasks for me to complete independently. For larger jobs, we can split the time between an initial working session, implementation and a final review.</p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">This is working time, not just advice. The aim is to finish with something actually done.</p>
