<section class="quick" id="consultancy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Business Systems &amp; Technology Consultancy</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">From £495, scoped to your business</h2>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;"><strong>Your business systems should make life easier, not create more work.</strong></p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">As your business develops, the technology behind it doesn't always keep up. You might be juggling disconnected systems, spending hours on repetitive admin, paying for tools you barely use or trying to work out how to build something your existing software can't do.</p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">I help businesses understand what's happening behind the scenes, identify what's not working and put practical solutions in place.</p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">Sometimes that means simplifying what you've already got. Sometimes it's connecting systems, introducing automation or building something more bespoke. The starting point is always what your business actually needs, not a particular tool or technology.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:28px;">What can I help with?</h3>
    <ul style="margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:22px; color:#3a4456; line-height:1.8;">
      <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Systems and process reviews:</strong> Understanding how your business operates, identifying bottlenecks, unnecessary costs and opportunities to improve.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Workflow improvements:</strong> Simplifying everyday processes, reducing repetitive admin and helping information move more efficiently between systems.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Automation and implementation:</strong> Connecting tools, building workflows and implementing practical solutions.</li>
      <li><strong>Bespoke systems and applications:</strong> Exploring and developing tailored solutions where existing tools aren't the right fit.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:28px;">How it works</h3>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px;">We'll start with a conversation about your business, what's currently happening and what you're trying to achieve.</p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">From there, I'll recommend the most sensible approach. That might be a focused review, a specific implementation project or a more involved piece of consultancy and development work.</p>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px;">A paid review isn't automatically required before implementation. If the requirements are clear, we can move directly to scoping the work.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:17px;margin-top:28px;">Pricing</h3>
    <p class="quick-line" style="line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px;">Consultancy starts from <strong>£495</strong> for a focused, scoped engagement. Larger reviews, implementation and bespoke development are quoted individually according to the work involved. You'll receive a clear proposal before we begin.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/5X8u7FaaufFGnoS19" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Chat About Your Systems</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

